#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:1
msgid "Multiple controller ownership"
msgstr "多控制器所有权"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:3
msgid ""
"The public I/O faces keep their existing operation tables and caller-owned "
"request contracts. Selecting another physical controller creates another "
"private provider instance, not another transport abstraction or global "
"registry. An instance's cold register, clock, DMA and IRQ facts remain "
"immutable until its publisher set has been withdrawn and the instance "
"stopped."
msgstr ""
"公共 I/O "
"接口面保持既有方法表与调用方持有的请求合同。选择另一个物理控制器会建立另一个私有提供者实例，而不是增加传输抽象或全局注册表。实例的冷态寄存器、时钟、DMA"
" 和 IRQ 事实在发布者集合撤销且实例停止前保持不可变。"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:9
msgid "I2C V1 IRQ and finite DMA"
msgstr "I2C V1 IRQ 与有限 DMA"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:11
msgid ""
"STM32F407 I2C1 and I2C2 execute the same maintained V1 register algorithm. "
"Per-controller cold wrappers validate all register pointers, DATA offsets, "
"line inputs, bus clocks and DMA selectors against the actual SDK. Their EV, "
"ER, RX DMA and TX DMA IRQs come from the selected controller identity. "
"Initialization of an already enabled physical controller returns `BUSY` "
"before changing its control registers or IRQ priorities."
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 的 I2C1 与 I2C2 执行同一套受维护 V1 寄存器算法。各控制器的冷态包装层依据真实 SDK 验证全部寄存器指针、DATA "
"偏移、线路输入、总线时钟和 DMA 选择器。EV、ER、RX DMA 和 TX DMA IRQ "
"均来自所选控制器身份。初始化已启用的物理控制器时，在改变其控制寄存器或 IRQ 优先级前返回 `BUSY`。"

