#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:23
msgid ""
"A DMA request selector never identifies or allocates a memory engine. Static "
"cold assembly must reject other devices that select an already owned physical"
" engine."
msgstr "DMA 请求选择器既不标识也不分配内存引擎。静态冷态装配必须拒绝其他设备选择已被持有的物理引擎。"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:27
msgid ""
"Setting the private state's DMA descriptor to `NULL` selects IRQ-only "
"messages and acquires no DMA vector. Exact immutable macros "
"`NX_STM32_I2C2_DMA(regions, count)` selects the secondary finite routes. The "
"initialization API is unchanged. Pin, bus clock, DMA clock and shared "
"resource leases remain cold assembly's responsibility; the provider does not "
"silently allocate these resources."
msgstr ""
"将私有状态的 DMA 描述符设为 `NULL`，即选择仅 IRQ 消息模式，不取得 DMA 向量。精确不可变宏 "
"`NX_STM32_I2C2_DMA(regions, count)` 选择第二控制器的有限传输路线。初始化 API 不变。引脚、总线时钟、DMA "
"时钟与共享资源租约仍由冷态装配负责；provider 不会静默分配这些资源。"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:34
msgid ""
"Each request retains its descriptor, messages, buffers and endpoint until "
"that controller's engine, interrupt sources and wire have drained. Completing"
" or cancelling one instance cannot acknowledge another stream's W1C flags, "
"disable its vectors, release its request or change its wake sink. A refused "
"DMA disable retains only the affected instance's borrow in `DRAINING` or "
"`QUARANTINED`; elapsed time does not prove hardware quiescence."
msgstr ""
"每个请求保留描述符、消息、缓冲区和端点，直到该控制器的引擎、中断源与线侧完成排空。一个实例的完成或取消不能确认另一 stream 的 W1C "
"标志、关闭其向量、释放其请求或改变其唤醒接收器。DMA 拒绝停止时，仅受影响实例的借用保留在 `DRAINING` 或 "
"`QUARANTINED`；时间流逝不能证明硬件静止。"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:41
msgid ""
"The shared DMA acknowledge leaf compiles to a direct selected register write."
" Its test override models the real W1C side effect rather than treating a "
"clear register as ordinary RAM. There is no per-byte MMIO operation table or "
"new mutable field. Actual Cortex-M4F compilation measures the unchanged state"
" at 56 bytes, endpoint at 8 bytes and optional immutable DMA descriptor at 80"
" bytes. The provider and shared algorithm objects contain zero global "
"DATA/BSS. Selected object text size is evidence of a compiled object, not an "
"entire image's retained Flash size or a cycle measurement."
msgstr ""
"共享 DMA 确认叶子编译为直接写入所选寄存器。测试覆盖模拟真实 W1C 副作用，而不是把清除寄存器当普通 RAM。没有逐字节 MMIO "
"方法表或新增可变字段。真实 Cortex-M4F 编译测得不变状态为 56 字节、端点 8 字节、可选不可变 DMA 描述符 80 "
"字节。提供者与共享算法对象的全局 DATA/BSS 为零。选中对象的 text 大小只是编译对象证据，不代表完整镜像保留的 Flash 或周期测量。"

#: docs/design/multiple-controllers.md:50
msgid ""
"The reviewed silicon route source is STM32 RM0090 Rev22 Table 43. These facts"
" do not establish a board's external wiring. Secondary-board routes require "
"an explicit reviewed board configuration. Host tests model external CPU/MMIO "
"behavior, and real ARM compilation uses actual vendor SDK headers. Bus "
"timing, electrical levels and DMA contention still need hardware "
"qualification; no physical result is claimed here."
msgstr ""
"经审阅的芯片路线来源为 STM32 RM0090 Rev22 Table "
"43。这些事实不能证明开发板的外部接线。第二控制器的板级路线需要显式、经审阅的板卡配置。主机测试建模外部 CPU/MMIO 行为，真实 ARM "
"编译使用实际厂商 SDK 头。总线时序、电平和 DMA 争用仍需硬件资格验证；此处不声明物理结果。"
